      "signature": "IsLocked(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FTransactionallySafeMutex*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "This method may give surprising results and should be used with caution!\n- You cannot safely use this function to determine whether Lock() will block.\nYou may be in race with another thread which is also trying to lock the mutex.\n- If a Mutex is locked by the AutoRTFM thread, it will not fully release the mutex\nuntil the transaction fully succeeds or rolls back. Because of this, IsLocked may\nreturn true even after the mutex has been fully unlocked."
    },
